"1_1": {
"dialogue": "To start, select your attack from the menu below. You'll have to press the button twice.
[br][br]Press [b]Space[/b] once you've done so.",
"offset": Vector2(-520, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_10": {
"dialogue": "The first 2 rows of a transmutation hint shows how those 2 types will react to an attack.",
"offset": Vector2(380, 560),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_11": {
"dialogue": "You may have guessed what the 3rd row is hinting to you, but if not watch how you're typing reacts to my next attack.",
"offset": Vector2(820, 700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_12": {
"dialogue": "So not only will your typing react to your opponent's attacks (and vice versa), but your primary and secondary types can react together!",
"offset": Vector2(-400, 900),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_13",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_13": {
"dialogue": "Finally, just one more thing.
[br][br]So far, we've only been using [i]ranged[/i] attacks. My next attack will be [i]melee[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(0, 920),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_14": {
"dialogue": "Congratulations! Now you know everything there is to know about transmutations!",
"offset": Vector2(-220, 1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_15": {
"dialogue": "Why don't you finish off the battle here and head on your way.",
"offset": Vector2(160, 1300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_16": {
"dialogue": "Your attack channeled the element of [color=green]Green[/color], which reacted with my [color=Blue]Blue[/color] composition, creating [color=cyan]Cyan[/color].",
"offset": Vector2(-420, 40),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_17",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_17": {
"dialogue": "What's more, these reactions can have side effects![br][br] 
[ul]When [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmute into another [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a speed boost.[/ul]
[ul]The same goes for when a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into another [color=red]offensive element[/color].[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a defensive bonus.[/ul]
[ul] When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=red]offensive element[/color], they get an offensive bonus.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-60, 140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_19",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_18": {
"dialogue": "Press [i]E[/i] to pull up the type chart. Hovering over any of the colored squares will show that reaction's side effects.",
"offset": Vector2(1040, 420),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_19": {
"dialogue": "Offensive Types:
[ul][color=green]Green[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=purple]Purple[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=orange]Orange[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=red]Red[/color][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(320, 220),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_20",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_2": {
"dialogue": "Great! Now hover your mouse over me.  
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(-140, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_20": {
"dialogue": "Defensive Types:
[ul][color=Blue]Blue[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=Cyan]Cyan[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=magenta]Magenta[/color][/ul]
[ul][color=yellow]Yellow[/color][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(700, 260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Now what you're seeing is called the [i]transmutation hint[/i]. It might not make much sense, but that's okay. 
[br][br]Just remember that the top-right square is [el]cyan[/el].
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(240, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Now click on my health bar, then press the [i]End Turn[/i] button below.",
"offset": Vector2(638.034, -611.848),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_5": {
"dialogue": "Your attack channeled the element of [color=green]Green[/color], which reacted with my [color=Blue]Blue[/color] composition, creating [color=cyan]Cyan[/color].",
"offset": Vector2(-420, -260),
"options": {
