}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Blu"
},
"1_6": {
"dialogue": "What's more, these reactions can have side effects![br]
[ul]When [color=blue]cold colors[/color] transmute into another [color=blue]cold colors[/color], they get a speed boost.[/ul]
[ul]The same goes for when a [color=red]warm color[/color] transmutes into another [color=red]warm color[/color].[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=red]warm color[/color] transmutes into a  [color=blue]cold color[/color], they get a defensive bonus.[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=blue]cold color[/color] transmutes into a  [color=red]warm color[/color], they get an offensive bonus.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-40, -240),
"options": {
